.\" ROADMAP-AGENT manual page
.TH ROADMAP-AGENT 1 "2026-04-10" "ROADMAP-AGENT" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
roadmap-agent \- cross-platform Local AI Memory Palace CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B roadmap-agent
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
.br
.B rma
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ROADMAP-AGENT is a script-first local CLI that manages a roadmap workflow powered by project metadata in .rma.
.PP
It supports:
.IP \(bu 2
Dry-run planning and safe task-by-task execution
.IP \(bu 2
Local AI Memory Palace helper actions
.IP \(bu 2
Cross-platform operation on Windows, Linux, macOS, and Docker
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Initialize .rma metadata files and roadmap state.
.TP
.B status
Show project/branch/task and execution summary.
.TP
.B plan
Generate dry-run roadmap plan.
.TP
.B execute-one
Execute exactly one selected task from the plan.
.TP
.B unlock
Clear stale lock state.
.TP
.B persistence
Install global launchers and runtime with elevated privileges.
.TP
.B persistance
Alias of persistence.
.TP
.B help, -h, --help
Show detailed command help.
.TP
.B man
Show manual text.
.TP
.B menu
Open interactive hub and AI submenu (default).
.SH PERSISTENCE MODE
.SS Linux/macOS
Installs runtime to /usr/local/lib/roadmap-agent and launchers to /usr/local/bin.
Optionally updates shell rc PATH block without duplication.
Installs this manpage into /usr/local/share/man/man1.
Requires root or sudo.
.SS Windows
Requires Administrator privileges.
Installs runtime under C:\\Program Files\\Roadmap-Agent and updates Machine PATH once.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B .rma/description.md
Primary product/function context.
.TP
.B .rma/ui.md
Expected UI/UX behavior context.
.TP
.B .rma/stack.md
Tech stack and versions.
.TP
.B .rma/other.md
Additional operational or architectural context.
.SH SEE ALSO
README.md, docs/GETTING-STARTED.md, docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md
